# Antigravity Permanent Workspace Rules: Chronos HSC

## AUTO-UPDATE & RELEASE WORKFLOW (MANDATORY ON EVERY BUILD/UPDATE)
Whenever the user asks to update the app, fix a bug, or generate an APK:
1. Increment `versionCode` by +1 and bump `versionName` in `app/build.gradle.kts`.
2. Update `version.json` in the project root matching `versionCode`, `versionName`, `apkUrl`, and `releaseNotes`.
3. Always sign using the permanent `app/keystore/release-key.jks` (configured in `keystore.properties` and shared across `debug` and `release`).
4. Output exact file paths for the newly signed APK and updated `version.json`.
5. Push APK and changes to GitHub repo https://github.com/Shajidur-Rahman/To_Do_Task_STUDY.git.
